079a603b936c7c22213b808e9c7bdef03193799ab72","file":"preprints/The-Subcritical-Henon-Lane-Emden-Conjecture-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":44,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"e99c961ecded60ac8efc33addeeff4d5a5eee63c53a3c44a2da8c047897bc986","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/The-Subcritical-Henon-Lane-Emden-Conjecture-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:aecffa70def3bee37c39d079a603b936c7c22213b808e9c7bdef03193799ab72","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/The-Subcritical-Henon-Lane-Emden-Conjecture-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L44"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nLet \\(n\\ge2\\) be an integer, let \\(p,q>0\\), and let \\(A,B\\in\\R\\).\nSuppose that\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:subcritical}\n \\frac{n+A}{p+1}+\\frac{n+B}{q+1}>n-2.\n\\end{equation}\nThere are no functions\n\\[\n u,v\\in C^2(\\R^n\\setminus\\{0\\})\\cap C(\\R^n),\n \\qquad u(x)>0,\\quad v(x)>0\\quad(x\\in\\R^n),\n\\]\nsatisfying Equation~\\eqref{eq:system} at every \\(x\\ne0\\)."}
